# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# FrameTlmProcessor telemetry channels
#
# One channel per scanline of the (possibly downsampled) frame. Only
# rows 0..height-1 are written per frame; higher-numbered channels
# stay silent at reduced sizes. Generated: keep entries uniform.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

